	(text "PACK INPUT + POWER SWITCH"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fb229f82-aa3e-4137-98f2-33221b3c4b74")
	)
	(text "J3 takes the smart pack's XT30U-F lead (kicad-pack/goosepack):\npin 1 GND = the pack's protected PACK-, pin 2 PACK+ (fused in the pack).\nCharging, protection and the 15 A fuse live in the pack.\nSW1 only drives Q1's gate; R40 holds Q1 off. Motor current\nflows through Q1 (AO4407A P-FET). With SW1 off nothing loads\nthe pack, so a protector trip clears (load removal).\nVSYS soft start: C71 (gate-drain) + R41 ramp VSYS in ~70 us\n(3-4 A inrush); C72 keeps fast pack edges from turning Q1 on.\nD4 (SMF14A) clamps VSYS: ~19 V at 3 A (DRV8871 50 V abs max)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "468c41e0-b4de-4946-80ae-c9a8e44c5d4e")
	)
	(text "U8 makes 5 V from VBUS (up to 30 V in), so the MCU runs from USB\nalone: program it with no pack or the switch off.\nD2/D3 OR that with the buck's VCC. Keep U8's load to the MCU (~50 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 259.08 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "126711bb-8284-40eb-908a-f20cf45a92e5")
	)
	(text "USB-C: programming only (no charging). R99/R100 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2\nmake it a plain 5 V sink. D+/D- continue on the MCU & USB sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "625ca62a-0a0a-448c-8864-b077868f4e7f")
	)
	(text "USB-C (PROGRAMMING)"
